    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Head of Section Two, report to Office 314 immediately!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571780/extras/e46ffad6f2cb8ba2fd2954b02580b574.poster.avif?t=1749742015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571780/extras/e46ffad6f2cb8ba2fd2954b02580b574.webm?t=1749742015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571780/extras/e46ffad6f2cb8ba2fd2954b02580b574.mp4?t=1749742015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Techno Prank</strong> is an immersive simulator of a techno prankster\u2019s life \u2014 a chaotic blend of creativity, absurdity, and total audio mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find phone numbers, call people using pre-recorded lines from others, record their shocked replies, and reuse them to trick the next poor soul. Dig into your victims\u2019 secrets, uncover weird mysteries, and turn your mischief into a full-blown show for your growing audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Talk Like You Belong</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll meet <strong>dozens of unique characters</strong> who aren't too happy to hear from strangers at first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use familiar voices to earn their trust, take advantage of duty or emotion, and push them deeper into surreal conversations. Or just sit back and enjoy the beautiful chaos you\u2019ve created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You can throw in any recorded phrase \u2014 from anyone, at any time</strong>. Even use your target\u2019s own voice! But be careful \u2014 if something feels off, they\u2019ll hang up and ghost you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571780/extras/e1707653c1f80ed2b7d76b618df868fb.avif?t=1749742015\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Art of the Prank</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stream your calls live in-game to build your fanbase, grab donations, and climb the viral ladder. Become the most notorious prankster on the net\u2026 unless the police catch wind of what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll start small \u2014 cheap food, random gigs, and terrible sleep. But it\u2019s all worth it for your creative rise to chaos stardom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check the prankster community daily for new phrases and fresh targets. Who knows who\u2019s next on the list?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571780/extras/d0618b2cdaf68ec4c830663d4561abed.avif?t=1749742015\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more phrases you collect, the more combinations you can create \u2014 and the deeper your conversations will go. Absurdity, freedom, and improvisation are your tools. The rest? That\u2019s up to your twisted imagination.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Head of Section Two, report to Office 314 immediately!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571780/extras/e46ffad6f2cb8ba2fd2954b02580b574.poster.avif?t=1749742015\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571780/extras/e46ffad6f2cb8ba2fd2954b02580b574.webm?t=1749742015\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571780/extras/e46ffad6f2cb8ba2fd2954b02580b574.mp4?t=1749742015\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Techno Prank</strong> is an immersive simulator of a techno prankster\u2019s life \u2014 a chaotic blend of creativity, absurdity, and total audio mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find phone numbers, call people using pre-recorded lines from others, record their shocked replies, and reuse them to trick the next poor soul. Dig into your victims\u2019 secrets, uncover weird mysteries, and turn your mischief into a full-blown show for your growing audience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Talk Like You Belong</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll meet <strong>dozens of unique characters</strong> who aren't too happy to hear from strangers at first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use familiar voices to earn their trust, take advantage of duty or emotion, and push them deeper into surreal conversations. Or just sit back and enjoy the beautiful chaos you\u2019ve created.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>You can throw in any recorded phrase \u2014 from anyone, at any time</strong>. Even use your target\u2019s own voice! But be careful \u2014 if something feels off, they\u2019ll hang up and ghost you forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571780/extras/e1707653c1f80ed2b7d76b618df868fb.avif?t=1749742015\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Art of the Prank</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stream your calls live in-game to build your fanbase, grab donations, and climb the viral ladder. Become the most notorious prankster on the net\u2026 unless the police catch wind of what you're doing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019ll start small \u2014 cheap food, random gigs, and terrible sleep. But it\u2019s all worth it for your creative rise to chaos stardom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Check the prankster community daily for new phrases and fresh targets. Who knows who\u2019s next on the list?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1571780/extras/d0618b2cdaf68ec4c830663d4561abed.avif?t=1749742015\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The more phrases you collect, the more combinations you can create \u2014 and the deeper your conversations will go. Absurdity, freedom, and improvisation are your tools. The rest? That\u2019s up to your twisted imagination.</p>",
